1
00:01:33,039 --> 00:01:34,370
What are you doing here?

2
00:01:37,479 --> 00:01:38,160
Shiya.

3
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,479
I regret it.

4
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:46,210
I don't agree to you marrying Pei Ning.

5
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,680
We are already divorced.

6
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,490
It's none of your business.

7
00:01:58,720 --> 00:01:59,440
Go back.

8
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,400
What if I say no?

9
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:06,200
Shiya.

10
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,360
You must come home with me right now.

11
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,240
Why should I?

12
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:27,880
Shiya.

13
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,680
I can't explain it to you clearly right now.

14
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:42,250
I don't want to lose you.

15
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,320
For the past three years,

16
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,600
I failed you.

17
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,040
I was always busy

18
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,890
and ignored your feelings.

19
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,040
But,

20
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:12,880
can you please not marry Pei Ning tomorrow?

21
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,720
What's the point of saying this now?

22
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:20,680
It's too late.

23
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:29,400
Look at you.

24
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,920
Why did you have to come here

25
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:32,520
just to humiliate yourself?

26
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,380
You don't understand.

27
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,720
You understand?

28
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,620
If you understood,

29
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:43,640
you wouldn't have agreed to divorce Shiya.

30
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:45,760
A good horse doesn't return to the old pasture.

31
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,820
I advise you to stop bothering Shiya.

32
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:10,520
Shiya.

33
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,840
I really don't know

34
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,170
how to explain it to you.

35
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:29,770
But you really can't marry Pei Ning tomorrow.

36
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:32,159
Did you hear what I said to you?

37
00:04:32,159 --> 00:04:33,690
Are you done making a scene?

38
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,860
Pour me a drink.

39
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:52,720
Pei Ning

40
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:53,760
is here.

41
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,980
Where is Shiya?

42
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,720
Have you eaten?

43
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:58,600
Why did you drink so much?

44
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,600
Shiya hasn't been answering my calls.

45
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,860
Did she drink too much?

46
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,480
What a considerate husband.

47
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,680
I think you love Shiya

48
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,040
even more than your brother does.

49
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,200
Jingyan, you are drunk.

50
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,560
Shiya hasn't been answering my calls.

51
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,720
I am worried about her.

52
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,840
I am taking her with me.

53
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:13,440
No.

54
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:14,960
Pei Ning.

55
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,200
First, tell me

56
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:18,640
what method you used

57
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,240
in such a short time

58
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,960
to capture Shiya's heart.

59
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:24,600
Eddie,

60
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,160
she is drunk.

61
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:26,960
Take her to rest.

62
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,160
I'm fine.

63
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,720
Pei Ning.

64
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:33,920
I'm fine.

65
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:43,970
Shiya, Pei Ning is here.

66
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,760
Ours was a marriage of convenience.

67
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:48,560
You didn't even show up for the divorce.

68
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,760
You said you were abroad and sent a lawyer.

69
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,420
You suddenly showed up today.

70
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,920
Are you afraid of gossip?

71
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,720
Your ex-wife suddenly became your sister-in-law,

72
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,580
and you're afraid of losing face.

73
00:05:58,640 --> 00:05:59,800
Or do you want to say

74
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,980
that you want to tell me

75
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,560
you still love me?

76
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:15,160
If you have nothing to say, just go back.

77
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,600
Shiya.

78
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:41,720
Shiya.

79
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:42,680
Are you in there?

80
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,800
I'm coming in, Shiya.

81
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,159
Shiya.

82
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,700
I called you so many times,

83
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:41,140
but you didn't answer.

84
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,440
I was very worried about you.

85
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,169
Are you okay?

86
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:48,020
I just went crazy with my sisters.

87
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,360
I spilled wine all over myself.

88
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,820
I'll be out after a shower.

89
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:08,680
Then.

90
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,500
I'll stay with you.

91
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,800
You go down first.

92
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:13,680
Pei Song.

93
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,680
I don't know why you came here today,

94
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:17,200
but we are already over.

95
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,000
Please leave.

96
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,400
Shiya.

97
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,360
Shiya, please believe me.

98
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,200
Please leave.
